           dependency: 'XCTest'" in target 'TeslaSync' (first reported at AIRestorePanel.Tests.swift:18, … and the
           same applies to this surface's ResetSection.Tests / .AdapterTests). Root cause is the repo-wide source
           composition: project.yml adds the WHOLE TeslaSync/feature-views directory — which holds 200+ co-located
           *.Tests.swift across peer surfaces — to the APP target's sources, and XCTest is not available to an
           iOS-simulator app target. The generated project.pbxproj confirms ResetSection.Tests.swift is a member
           of BOTH app targets' Sources phases (the same convention every P4 feature-view ships with). A grep of
           the iOS log for "ResetSection*.swift:NN:CC: error" = 0 hits — the surface itself has no compile error.
